<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>微积分 - 标签 - ∅AxiomLab</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/tags/%E5%BE%AE%E7%A7%AF%E5%88%86/</link><description>∅AxiomLab</description><generator>Hugo 0.162.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 20:01:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.sunisalex.org/tags/%E5%BE%AE%E7%A7%AF%E5%88%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>天体运动:最终章</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/celestial-movement/</link><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 20:01:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/celestial-movement/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>本文系统介绍了天体运动中的几个核心专题，包括拉格朗日点的求解与小量近似、双曲线与抛物线轨道问题、开普勒第一定律的微积分推导，以及若干典型习题的详细解答。</description></item><item><title>天体运动:万有引力定律应用</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/application-of-the-law-of-gravitation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 21:10:44 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/application-of-the-law-of-gravitation/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>以轨道力学为主线，依次讨论椭圆轨道的几何与物理性质、 抛物线轨道的面积速度法、三体稳定转动的拉格朗日解、 位力定理的一般形式及其在天体系统中的应用， 以及潮汐力的本质、洛希极限的推导与转动参考系下的卫星轨道变化。</description></item><item><title>天体运动:万有引力定律</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/universal-law-of-graviation/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 15:25:39 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/universal-law-of-graviation/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>万有引力定律全景:从开普勒三定律到三大宇宙速度,辅以球壳引力、双星三星、天体能量等专题与例题精解。</description></item><item><title>微积分基础导论:微积分应用2</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-04/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 16:32:22 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-04/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-04/image.png' alt="alt text" height="562" width="864"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>微积分基础导论:微积分应用1</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-03/</link><pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 21:53:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-03/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>本文介绍微积分在物理中的应用，涵盖质心计算（圆锥、半球壳、半球体）、保守力势能与平衡稳定性判据、泰勒小量展开及其在电偶极子受力、相对论动能还原、非均匀浮力等经典问题中的应用。</description></item><item><title>微积分基础导论:简易积分</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-02/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 16:39:58 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-02/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>从质量积分出发，系统介绍不定积分与定积分的概念、常用公式及换元法，并通过重心计算、n维球体积推导、阻力运动等物理例题，展示积分在竞赛物理中的实际应用。</description></item><item><title>微积分基础导论:极限与导数</title><link>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-01/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 16:37:18 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.sunisalex.org/posts/physics/basic-calculus-01/</guid><category domain="https://blog.sunisalex.org/categories/%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86/">物理</category><description>&lt;p&gt;本文中涉及到的微积分服务于&lt;strong&gt;物理竞赛&lt;/strong&gt;,侧重于&lt;strong&gt;实用性&lt;/strong&gt;,而非&lt;strong&gt;严谨性&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>